   "text": "Trainium2 96 GB · NVIDIA H100 80 GB · H200 141 GB · B200 192 GB\ntrn2.48xlarge: 16 Trainium2 = 1.5 TiB HBM · Trn2 UltraServer: 64 chips = 6 TiB, linked by NeuronLink\np5en.48xlarge: 8 × H200 = 1,128 GB HBM, linked by NVLink",
